   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>Default Error Tracer (DET)</h2><p class=\"lead\">The DET handles development errors, runtime errors, and transient faults across all BSW modules and SW-Cs.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
